WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:06.940
Goku to the punch was the silent giant Android 16 whose attempt to stop Cell was quickly

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:13.410
shattered along with his metal body and seeing Gohan's reaction to the androids death gave

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:29.030
Cell a new strategy so Gohan we still haven't gotten you mad let's try some friendly persuasion

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.040
the unthinkable happen. Cell spawned from his tail seven miniature versions of himself

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.460
to attack the Z fighters with the hope that watching his friends in pain would cause Gohan

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:55.910
to unleash his hidden strength. My dear children, those seven on the cliff are your enemies.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.000
Give them pain. Kill them if it makes sense.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:10.620
How will Goku and the others fare

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.620
against these frightening creatures?

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.620
Will this be the key to triggering Gohan's power?

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:19.620
Find out today on Dragon Ball Z.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:14.600
*Gunshot*

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.490
are being pummeled by these new little monsters.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.090
Everyone is fighting at once in an all-out punching frenzy.

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:11.970
No rules, no order, and no hope for any of us.

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:14.570
Unless, of course.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:17.170
Please, Hercule, how is it?

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.180
Huh?

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.740
Your dreadful stomach virus, how is it?

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:24.330
You know, just because I don't scream and whine about it

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.510
all the time like a little sizzly doesn't mean

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.060
that it still isn't threatening my life.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.000
Ow.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:35.190
A stomach pain like this would have killed any normal man!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:38.690
I'm the only guy in the world with the strength to bear it!

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.840
Wow! That's very impressive.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:46.340
So, it still hurts.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:51.340
Ouchie, ouchie, ouchie! Oh, the terrible pain! Make it stop!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.840
I still have some of that medicine for you.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:58.710
No! Too much pain to swallow anything!

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:09.640
I agree.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:03.380
We have to protect him!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:10.950
We have to die!

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.790
You don't need to thank us, we're a team.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:50.890
is beginning to swell good take your anger and feed off of it use it to unleash your power

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:58.790
before it's too late for your friends just take a look out there no one but vegeta and trunks can

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.000
still defend themselves

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.040
Not even your father.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.340
He, too, will die.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:17.810
This is absolute madness!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.350
They're nothing but children!

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.000
up this way.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:07.830
Dad, why did you count on me so much?

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:12.790
If you're so sure I have all this power, then tell me how to bring it out.

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.220
What the hell?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:34.580
You are watching Dragon Ball Z. Only tonight.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.020
Horrid. Today's been weird.

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:30.000
More time playing with petty creatures like you, understand?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.280
DISAPPEAR!

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:47.700
We can't keep filming when we're torn into pieces.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.720
Yes, good point.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:53.230
What do you say we get on out of here?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.820
Fans will understand.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:58.840
Maestro Hercule, go with them, please, yes?

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.000
Go if you want.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.780
A true champion never runs from danger.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.320
So you're going to stay here?

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.490
You bet!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:12.100
First I'll go to the hospital to fix my stomach, of course, but then I'll return!

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:15.510
Huh?

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:18.180
To the doctor so I can come back and win!

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:24.740
Wait, that's you?

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:26.850
I don't know!

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:45.750
I don't hate me.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:49.000
Me.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.370
Go.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.870
Please take me to the area where the rest of them are fighting.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:13:00.000
He's talking!

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:04.570
It is... for the good of the Earth.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:09.490
You must be insane! Cell and all his little minions are out there!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:14.580
Yeah, that's right! We can't let our Hercule go out into such a dangerous mess!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:23.230
I thought you would be eager to help the planet, or its greatest champion, are you not?

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:30.000
Hercule is the world champion of mankind, and that doesn't include monsters like you and Cell!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:37.280
you got it hey shut up they might be monsters but i can crush them all with one hand i just

00:13:37.280 --> 00:14:00.000
need a doctor first help me champion it's not a body yes that's what

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.090
What happens when you get too close to Cell?

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.730
-Hercule, listen! -Enough!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.790
-Hercule, you'll get killed! -Leave me alone!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:30.000
All these nobodies out there and even now a kid is fighting Cell!

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:38.880
be shameful of a world champion to run away but Hercule will it be okay if I

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:59.440
just take you somewhere close yes thank you

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.040
- Just a little more until he pops.

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.080
- I can certainly manage that.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.660
- Over children, you can kill them now.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:59.000
- Yeah!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:15:59.890
- This is all he needs.

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:27.810
I threw him too far!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:45.230
let it go. It is not a sin to fight for the right cause. There are those who words alone

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:53.170
will not reach. Cell is such a being. I know how you feel, Gohan. You are gentle. You do

00:16:53.170 --> 00:17:00.000
not like to hurt. I know because I, too, have learned these feelings. But it is because you

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.040
cherished life, that you must protect it.

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:08.240
This sentimental downpour is killing me.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:10.880
It's so nice of you to help, Sixteen.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:15.020
But I plan on doing this my way.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:20.800
Please, drop your restraints.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.270
Protect the life I love.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.110
You have the strength.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.010
My scanner sensed it.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.890
Just let it go.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:59.030
It's another fighter you could have saved.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.340
I have to say that you're just an android.

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:15.570
I can't do that.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.300
I won't watch anymore.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.740
I feel it slipping.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:20.800
I feel it slipping.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.000
secret we have known before Gohan could

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.840
even form words in his mouth.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:03.520
Through fights with Raditz,

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.560
Garlic Jr., the Ginyu Force,

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.680
and even Frieza, we've caught

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.760
glimpses of the child's explosive power.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.560
But like an explosion,

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.600
it always vanished with a moment.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.200
It couldn't be controlled.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:16.980
Until now.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.650
At last, the beastly power has been

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:24.470
harnessed. Now Cell

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.850
will battle a warrior 11 years in the making

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.140
on the next

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.000
Dragon Ball Z.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:47.000
This time on Dragon Ball Z, Gohan's muscles erupt with his newly bridled power and Cell sends his children to test a boy's strength all at once.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:55.960
The Cell juniors reveal they too know the Z fighters special moves, but it's too little too late and Gohan is prepared to destroy.
